2. **High-Risk Soil Challenge:** The presence of vast deposits of soft soils, saturated sands, and alluvium in many key urban and infrastructure corridors makes **liquefaction** a critical failure mode that must be assessed, especially using CPT and SPT data (which your bot already processes).
