| **2. Liquefaction Screening** | **Soil Vulnerability Check (Triggering):** Integrate the "simplified procedure" to determine the Cyclic Resistance Ratio (CRR) and Cyclic Stress Ratio (CSR) to calculate the Factor of Safety against liquefaction (FS_L). | Commonly uses **IS 2131:1981** (SPT) or **IS 4968:1976** (CPT correlation) and the **IS 1893** criteria for site soil type. This is a massive value-add for sites with water-saturated sandy/silty soils. |
